    "author": "Aubert, B. and others",
    "collaboration": "BaBar",
    "title": "Search for the Rare Decay $B \\to \\pi \\ell^{+} \\ell^{-}$",
    "arxiv": "[hep-ex/0703018v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-ex/0703018)",
    "time": "2007.03.07",
    "abstract": "We have performed a search for the flavor-changing neutral-current decays $B \\to \\pi \\ell^{+} \\ell^{-}$, where $\\ell^{+} \\ell^{-}$ is either $e^{+} e^{-}$ or $\\mu^{+} \\mu^{-}$, using a sample of 230 million $B\\bar{B}$ events collected with the BaBar detector at the $\\Upsilon(4S)$ resonance. We observe no evidence of a signal and measure the upper limit on the isospin-averaged branching fraction to be $\\mathcal{B}(B \\to \\pi \\ell^{+} \\ell^{-}) < 9.1 \\times 10^{-8}$ at 90% confidence level. We also search for the lepton-flavor-violating decays $B \\to \\pi e^{\\pm} \\mu^{\\mp}$ and measure an upper limit on the isospin-averaged branching fraction of $\\mathcal{B}(B \\to \\pi e^{\\pm} \\mu^{\\mp}) < 9.2 \\times 10^{-8}$ at 90% confidence level.",
    "pdf": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-ex/0703018",
    "transition-mode": "semi-leptonic decay",
